       "features": [
        {
         "id": "talent-9-1a",
         "name": "Fortress of Perfect Thought",
         "description": "\nYour mind is an impenetrable palace that shields you from danger. You gain the following effects:\n\n* You can breathe even when there is no breathable air.\n* Creatures can\u2019t read your thoughts unless you allow them to.\n* Your Reason and Intuition are treated as 2 higher for the purpose of resisting the potency of abilities.",
